        <briefdescription>
<para>Resolves <computeroutput>#id</computeroutput> anchor references to the target file and normalized fragment identifier. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>For tokens carrying <ref refid="structjam_1_1LanguageRole_1aa57ab486efc0ee9fcf67aff944739560ad7df63664e092d445c3779e56fc8a1bb" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::LanguageRole::reference</ref> (such as <computeroutput>href</computeroutput> values), splits <computeroutput>name</computeroutput> at <computeroutput>#</computeroutput>: the substring before <computeroutput>#</computeroutput> resolves relative to <computeroutput>file&apos;s</computeroutput> parent directory (or <computeroutput>file</computeroutput> itself when empty for same-file <computeroutput>#id</computeroutput> anchors), and the substring after <computeroutput>#</computeroutput> is hashed via <ref refid="class_built_in_language_1a554a0a4d4b5ab2d93603ddd8a43b2c61" kindref="member">getSymbolHash()</ref>. Declarations fall back to <ref refid="class_built_in_language_1a28bcb8d7e1d8d47ec696b7feab03c529" kindref="member">BuiltInLanguage::getSymbol()</ref>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>file</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>HTML file containing the token. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>name</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Token text (tag name, <computeroutput>id</computeroutput> value, or <computeroutput>href</computeroutput> destination). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>role</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Bitmask of <ref refid="structjam_1_1LanguageRole" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::LanguageRole</ref> flags for the token slot. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>64-bit symbol identifier matching the target declaration. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
